Native SIF RPC bind/call/end through the existing IOP bridge, registered queues and console clock.
The EE original completion handler receives RPC_END over the real SIF0 transport.
Reference: ps2dev/ps2sdk common/include/sifrpc-common.h and iop/system/sifcmd/src/sifrpc.c.
Maintainer approved this HLE protocol coverage on 2026-11-15.

